{"title":"Mode","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Definition\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Definition</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Problems\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problems</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Mean,_Median,_Mode\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Mean, Median, Mode</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Definition\">Definition</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mode&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Definition\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Finite\" title=\"Finite\">finite</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Multiset\" title=\"Multiset\">multiset</a>, the <b>mode</b> is the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Element\" title=\"Element\">element</a> (or set of elements) that appears the most times.  For example, in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/3/b33c95a207c54b264c4564fdeada81708af73286.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,1,3,5,6,7,7,7,7,8\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"180\" height=\"18\" />, the mode is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problems\">Problems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mode&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Problems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>find the mode of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/e/15eb2bdea8fd135468baaa977c991f9432ecb451.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2, 4, 4, 4, 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Mean.2C_Median.2C_Mode\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mean,_Median,_Mode\">Mean, Median, Mode</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mode&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Mean, Median, Mode\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/TkZvMa30Juo?t=1504\">https://youtu.be/TkZvMa30Juo?t=1504</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mode&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mean\" title=\"Mean\">Mean</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Median\" title=\"Median\">Median</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Mode&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report